/** @defgroup bflat_ts_calls bflat build - Calls and frames
 * @ingroup bflat_ts
 * @{
 *
 * @brief Tests of the calling convention and of the frames of managed methods.
 *
 *        The arguments and results of every width as they cross a call: an int
 *        in a 64-bit register, the small types, a 64-bit value in two
 *        registers or split with the stack, values that live across a
 *        P/Invoke. The frames those calls are made from: with and without a
 *        frame pointer, leaf methods that do not save RA, fast tail calls
 *        and calls that do not return.
 *
 *        A program prints "ALL PASS" and returns zero, or prints every
 *        failed check and returns non-zero. Where the compiler has a switch
 *        for what a program tests, a second run builds the same program with
 *        the switch the other way.
 *
 * @}
 */
